{
  "$schema": "./apps.schema.json",
  "_comment": "Data-driven manifest for Register-StartMenuApps.ps1. One entry per Phenotype DESKTOP app. NATIVE-ONLY: every shortcut targets a genuine native Electrobun launcher.exe (build/dev-win-x64/<App>-dev/bin/launcher.exe, PE32+), launched in DEV/HMR mode (live reload pointed at the running dev server). There is NO browser fallback — if an app's launcher.exe is not built, the registrar SKIPS it with a warning ('no native shell built — run electrobun build first'). electrobunBuildDir is relative to repoPath and points at the dir CONTAINING launcher.exe. EXCLUDED by decision: phenodocs (docs site, browser-only) and phenotype-auth-ts (library, not an app). CAVEATS (still included): AtomsBot is primarily a Discord bot with a minimal web UI; phenotype-org-governance has no dev server yet and needs a docs:dev script added before its shell HMRs.",
